{"crw-nogi-38130":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです、すみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら元気です(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外BREAK"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーの全国握手会が大阪から始まりましたね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は二曲参加してます。\nフルサイズでの披露だから緊張しますねぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"インフルエンサーのダンスも、身体に馴染んで楽しんで踊れるようになりました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は手足がついていかなくて苦戦したけど、踊れると楽しいもんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の全国握手会はゴールデンウィーク！名古屋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お会いできるのを楽しみにしてます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/mai.shiraishi/img/2017/04/17/0424866/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ray"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなと一緒で楽しかった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今朝、解禁になりましたが、映画「あさひなぐ」に宮路真春役で出演させていただきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真春は薙刀への愛が溢れていて、女性からみてもかっこいい女性です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くみなさんにお届けしたい！\n素敵な作品ができますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜放送の深イイ話でも撮影風景が少し流れると思うので、是非見てもらえたら嬉しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深イイ話、密着していただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２年ぶりに前回の女性ディレクターさんに密着してもらい、いろんな現場でいろんな姿を撮ってもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなVTRになっているのか、私も見ていないのでドキドキしますが、２年前の密着してもらった時と比べてどこか成長を感じてもらえたら嬉しいなぁと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今夜21時からですね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も暖かくて過ごしやすい〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方辺りから雨予報なので、お出かけする方は傘持っていこうー！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11942":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"公園大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブーン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポッポ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"鳩とたわむれようとするけどなんだか怖くて腰が引けてる系。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......はいっ！能條です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル東京公演もあと残りわずかになってきましたねぇ～...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか寂しい気もするわ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日、始めていつみに立候補させていただき選んでいただきました(^O^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつみとしてしっかり嫌な女になれたかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの2幕の瞬間だけでも皆さんに嫌いになってもらえるよう頑張りました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、栄に立候補しましたが、駄目でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"栄は前回演じた時に悔いが残ってしまったからどうしてもまた演じたくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日もリベンジしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたい事に選んでいただけました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また栄をやらせてもらえた事に感謝ですありがとうございます(/ _ ; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間の反省点をいかしのびのび演じることが出来た気がする。。うん。ん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は......ちょっと冒険してみようかなと思います❤❤❤❤❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えへへー楽しみーー  (๑･ิټ･ิ๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、練習始めます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/11/9823056/0004.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-18361":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"プ